WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.867
Change management goes beyond syntax.

00:00:02.867 --> 00:00:09.487
A create or replace command may succeed, but a meaningful change can still break analytics.

00:00:09.487 --> 00:00:16.622
Consumers may depend on a column name, data type, business definition, or row grain.

00:00:16.622 --> 00:00:20.783
Review those contract elements before changing a shared object.
